          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Find the value of the following and also draw their bar models. (i) 25% of 160 (ii) 16% of 250 (iii) 62% of 360 (iv) 140% of 40 (v) 1% of 1 hour (vi) 7% of 10 kg"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.258,
            0.845,
            0.305
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Surya made 60 ml of deep orange paint, how much red paint did he use if red paint made up "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 3 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " of the deep orange paint?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.312,
            0.845,
            0.442
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4. Pairs of quantities are shown below. Identify and write appropriate symbols ‘>’, ‘<’, ‘=’ in the boxes. Visualising or estimating can help. Compute only if necessary or for verification. (i) 50% of 510 50% of 515 (ii) 37% of 148 73% of 148 (iii) 29% of 43 92% of 110 (iv) 30% of 40 40% of 50 (v) 45% of 200 10% of 490 (vi) 30% of 80 24% of 64"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.445,
            0.512,
            0.466
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5. Fill in the blanks appropriately:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.211,
            0.475,
            0.846,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) 30% of k is 70, 60% of k is _, 90% of k is _, 120% of k is"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.517,
            0.845,
            0.556
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) 100% of m is 215, 10% of m is _, 1% of m is _, 6% of m is"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.559,
            0.846,
            0.598
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) 90% of n is 270, 9% of n is , 18% of n is _____, 100% of n is"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.201,
